processes, all 200s, confirming the Module 11 SQLite thread-local fix
also holds under gunicorn's multi-process model, not just Flask's dev
server; the two Kaggle training CSVs (~1.2MB) committed so Render's
build can retrain models/*.joblib from a clean clone without a Kaggle
API build secret; create_app() now auto-selects SupabaseDataStore over
SQLiteDataStore when SUPABASE_URL/SUPABASE_KEY are set (additive, no
change for any existing caller).

